# Intro - Foundation: Problem Solving and Planning

Before we diving into C++, it's essential to master problem-solving and planning. Programming is not just how to write down code, it's about thinking critically, breaking down complex problems and design efficient solutions.&#x20;

In this section, you will learn how to analysis problem, develop algorithm and structure your code efficiently. You will learn 3 methods to design and structure your code. By building a strong foundation in logical thinking, you will be more confident to tackle real-world coding challenges.&#x20;

Let's start by understanding the core problem-solving techniques that will set you up for success in C++!

